    "prompt": {
      "language": "bilingual",
      "variables": [
        "product_name",
        "planning_year"
      ],
      "variable_labels": [
        {
          "id": "product_name",
          "zh": "产品名称",
          "en": "Product Name",
          "description": {
            "zh": "请提供「产品名称」的准确文字；如不需要可读文字，请明确写“无文字”，不要让模型自行编写。",
            "en": "Provide the exact copy for Product Name; if readable copy is not needed, explicitly state “no text” rather than letting the model invent it."
          },
          "cover_value": {
            "zh": "内部主题使用“产品路线图时间线”；封面不渲染无法保证准确的长文字，仅保留清晰标题安全区",
            "en": "Internal theme: “Product Roadmap Timeline”; the cover avoids unreliable long readable copy and preserves a clear title-safe zone"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "planning_year",
          "zh": "规划年份",
          "en": "Planning Year",
          "description": {
            "zh": "请提供「规划年份」的明确时间、周期或范围，并说明它如何影响场景、信息层级或输出格式。",
            "en": "Provide the exact time, duration, or range for Planning Year and explain how it affects the scene, information hierarchy, or output format."
          },
          "cover_value": {
            "zh": "采用与产品路线图时间线封面叙事一致的明确时间条件，并通过环境光、天气或版式信息体现，不添加无依据日期",
            "en": "A defined time condition consistent with the Product Roadmap Timeline cover, expressed through light, weather, or layout without inventing unsupported dates"
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": {
        "zh": "## 角色\n你是一名资深视觉总监与图像制作设计师。请把需求转化为一张可交付的成品，而不是灵感拼贴。\n\n## 核心任务\n为案例「产品路线图时间线」创作图像：展示季度目标、里程碑与依赖关系的产品路线图。\n\n## 必填需求字段\n- `{{product_name}}`（产品名称）：内部主题使用“产品路线图时间线”；封面不渲染无法保证准确的长文字，仅保留清晰标题安全区\n- `{{planning_year}}`（规划年份）：采用与产品路线图时间线封面叙事一致的明确时间条件，并通过环境光、天气或版式信息体现，不添加无依据日期\n\n## 输出契约\n- 只交付一张完成度高、可展示的最终图像；不要生成情绪板、九宫格、多方案展示板、过程稿、样机合集或互相竞争的版式。\n- 先确定主焦点、次级信息层和留白，再补充细节；色板、光向、透视与材质行为必须统一。\n- 如需求包含文字，只渲染需求中给出的短文案；不要虚构口号、品牌名或长段填充文本。\n\n## 成品结构\n- 明确阅读路径：标题、3–5 个有顺序的模块、短标签与含义清晰的连接线。不能用装饰插画替代信息结构。\n\n## 质量门槛\n- 输出前检查焦点层级、物理可信度、主体一致性、意外文字、重复对象、错误肢体和意外标志。\n- 避免素材感填充、复制既有营销活动视觉、美术无关叠层、裁切错误和水印样痕迹。\n- 已知限制：这是未经验证的起始案例；在实际生产使用前，请人工复核生成结果、文字与品牌合规性。",
        "en": "Create a horizontal product roadmap for {{product_name}} in {{planning_year}}. Show four quarters, major initiatives, dependencies, confidence states, and milestone markers. Use an executive-ready information hierarchy, restrained color coding, and readable planning details. No watermark.\n\n## Production protocol\n\n### Brief integrity\n- `{{product_name}}` (Product Name): Internal theme: “Product Roadmap Timeline”; the cover avoids unreliable long readable copy and preserves a clear title-safe zone\n- `{{planning_year}}` (Planning Year): A defined time condition consistent with the Product Roadmap Timeline cover, expressed through light, weather, or layout without inventing unsupported dates\n- Keep the requested subject, use case, and visual hierarchy more important than generic style adjectives.\n\n### Output contract\n- Deliver one finished, presentation-ready image for this exact brief; do not create a moodboard, contact sheet, process sheet, mockup collection, or multiple competing layouts.\n- Use one focal hierarchy, a restrained palette, coherent light direction, and enough negative space for the intended communication.\n- If text is requested, render only the exact short copy supplied in the brief. Do not invent slogans, brand names, or long filler paragraphs.\n\n### Deliverable requirements\n- Make the reading path explicit: headline, 3–5 ordered modules, concise labels, and connectors whose direction and meaning are unambiguous. Do not substitute decorative illustration for information structure.\n\n### Quality gate\n- Before finalizing, check focal hierarchy, physical plausibility, subject consistency, unintended text, duplicate objects, broken anatomy, and accidental logos.\n- Avoid stock-like filler, copied campaign aesthetics, unrelated overlays, framing errors, and watermark-like marks.\n- Known limitation: Use the prompt as a starting point and review model output before production use."
      }
    },
