            "zh": "虚构且无商标的“咖啡包装系统”项目，品牌语气围绕品牌设计、包装、视觉识别，不出现真实公司、Logo 或未经证实的主张",
            "en": "A fictional unbranded Coffee Packaging System project, positioned around Brand Identity without real companies, logos, or unsupported claims"
