            "zh": "红油菜、清淡菜和绿色蔬菜交替分布，中央锅最大，外围菜盘大小有三级变化且同类器皿不重复",
            "en": "Red-oil, light, and green dishes alternate; the central pot is largest and surrounding plates use three size levels without duplicate vessels"
