          "cover_value": {
            "zh": "视觉图解、地图、流程设计相关受众；核心关注点是通过触点、情绪和机会点描绘完整用户体验路径。",
            "en": "An audience interested in Infographic, Educational Visual; the primary need is the use case described by Customer Journey Map"
          }
