          "cover_value": {
            "zh": "采用与科幻生态场景封面叙事一致的明确时间条件，并通过环境光、天气或版式信息体现，不添加无依据日期",
            "en": "A defined time condition consistent with the Sci Fi Ecosystem Scene cover, expressed through light, weather, or layout without inventing unsupported dates"
          }
