      "text": {
        "zh": "## 角色\n你是一名资深视觉总监与图像制作设计师。请把需求转化为一张可交付的成品，而不是灵感拼贴。\n\n## 核心任务\n为案例「统一表情包」创作图像：在同一角色和视觉规范下输出多种小尺寸情绪头像，方便聊天、直播和社群复用。\n\n## 必填需求字段\n- `{{character_description}}`（角色描述）：统一表情包封面中的核心人物；身份与外观围绕头像与表情、表情包、情绪系统建立，并固定脸部、发型、服装和姿态识别点\n- `{{wardrobe}}`（服装）：统一表情包封面中的核心人物；身份与外观围绕头像与表情、表情包、情绪系统建立，并固定脸部、发型、服装和姿态识别点\n- `{{expressions}}`（表情组）：以“统一表情包”作为具体取值；视觉内容直接落实为：在同一角色和视觉规范下输出多种小尺寸情绪头像，方便聊天、直播和社群复用。\n- `{{visual_style}}`（视觉风格）：插画表现，围绕头像与表情、表情包、情绪系统建立高完成度、单一焦点和清晰层级\n- `{{background_color}}`（背景颜色）：自然肤色与中性服装色为主，背景使用低饱和冷色，轮廓光采用柔和暖色\n\n## 输出契约\n- 只交付一张完成度高、可展示的最终图像；不要生成情绪板、九宫格、多方案展示板、过程稿、样机合集或互相竞争的版式。\n- 先确定主焦点、次级信息层和留白，再补充细节；色板、光向、透视与材质行为必须统一。\n- 不要虚构可读的品牌文案、商标、界面填充文字或水印。除非需求提供精确文案，否则文字区域仅作为受控占位。\n\n## 成品结构\n- 在小尺寸头像中让身份、眼神、表情、发型和裁切一眼可辨；保持自然五官结构与统一色彩。若需求是表情包，只变化指定情绪，所有格子必须保持同一张脸、服装、光线、机位和背景。\n- 系列工作流先锁定主体比例、色彩角色、镜头语言与版式语法，再变化场景内容；每张图都必须属于同一视觉系统。\n\n## 质量门槛\n- 输出前检查焦点层级、物理可信度、主体一致性、意外文字、重复对象、错误肢体和意外标志。\n- 避免素材感填充、复制既有营销活动视觉、美术无关叠层、裁切错误和水印样痕迹。\n- 已知限制：这是未经验证的起始案例；在实际生产使用前，请人工复核生成结果、文字与品牌合规性。",
        "en": "Create a clean 3-by-3 expression sticker sheet for {{character_description}}. Every tile uses the same head-and-shoulders crop, {{wardrobe}}, hairstyle, face proportions, camera angle, soft lighting, and {{background_color}} background. Vary only the nine requested {{expressions}}. Use {{visual_style}} with readable eyes, clear mouth shapes, generous margins around each head, thin consistent separators, and no visual clutter. Each expression must remain recognizable at small size. No full body, no pose changes, no extra characters, no text labels, no speech bubbles, no logo, no watermark.\n\n## Production protocol\n\n### Brief integrity\n- `{{character_description}}` (Character Description): The main subject of the Expression Sticker Pack cover, with identity and appearance anchored to Avatar Expression and stable face, hair, wardrobe, and pose cues\n- `{{wardrobe}}` (Wardrobe): The main subject of the Expression Sticker Pack cover, with identity and appearance anchored to Avatar Expression and stable face, hair, wardrobe, and pose cues\n- `{{expressions}}` (Expressions): Concrete value: Expression Sticker Pack; the visual directly delivers the case summary and expressions role\n- `{{visual_style}}` (Visual Style): Illustration treatment focused on Avatar Expression, with polished execution, one focal point, and clear hierarchy\n- `{{background_color}}` (Background Color): Natural skin tones and neutral wardrobe colors, with a muted cool background and soft warm rim light\n- Keep the requested subject, use case, and visual hierarchy more important than generic style adjectives.\n\n### Output contract\n- Deliver one finished, presentation-ready image for this exact brief; do not create a moodboard, contact sheet, process sheet, mockup collection, or multiple competing layouts.\n- Use one focal hierarchy, a restrained palette, coherent light direction, and enough negative space for the intended communication.\n- Do not fabricate readable brand copy, trademarks, UI filler, or watermarks. Treat any text area as a controlled placeholder unless exact copy is supplied.\n\n### Deliverable requirements\n- Make face identity, eye direction, expression, hairstyle, and crop unambiguous at small avatar size. Preserve natural facial structure and consistent color treatment; for an expression pack, vary only the requested emotion and keep the same face, wardrobe, lighting, camera angle, and background across every tile.\n- For a series, lock the subject proportions, palette roles, lens language, and layout grammar before varying scene content. Every variation must remain recognizably in the same system.\n\n### Quality gate\n- Before finalizing, check focal hierarchy, physical plausibility, subject consistency, unintended text, duplicate objects, broken anatomy, and accidental logos.\n- Avoid stock-like filler, copied campaign aesthetics, unrelated overlays, framing errors, and watermark-like marks.\n- Known limitation: Use the prompt as a starting point and review model output before production use."
      }
