            "zh": "请给出「主视觉颜色」的 2–4 个明确色名、主辅比例和使用位置；不要只写“高级”或“有氛围”。",
            "en": "Specify 2–4 named colors, their primary/secondary balance, and where Hero Color appears; avoid vague terms such as “premium” or “atmospheric”."
