      "text": {
        "zh": "## 角色\n你是一名资深视觉总监与图像制作设计师。请把需求转化为一张可交付的成品，而不是灵感拼贴。\n\n## 核心任务\n为案例「雨后街头东方女性特写」创作图像：在雨后城市的柔和反射光中拍摄真实东方女性近景，保留自然神情与皮肤细节。\n\n## 必填需求字段\n- `{{subject_description}}`（主体描述）：以“雨后街头东方女性特写”作为具体取值；视觉内容直接落实为：在雨后城市的柔和反射光中拍摄真实东方女性近景，保留自然神情与皮肤细节。\n- `{{wardrobe}}`（服装）：雨后街头东方女性特写封面中的核心人物；身份与外观围绕摄影、东方女性、人像特写建立，并固定脸部、发型、服装和姿态识别点\n- `{{city_context}}`（城市场景）：雨后街头东方女性特写所示的完整环境；空间必须直接支撑“在雨后城市的柔和反射光中拍摄真实东方女性近景，保留自然神情与皮肤细节。”并保留前景、中景和背景层次\n\n## 输出契约\n- 只交付一张完成度高、可展示的最终图像；不要生成情绪板、九宫格、多方案展示板、过程稿、样机合集或互相竞争的版式。\n- 先确定主焦点、次级信息层和留白，再补充细节；色板、光向、透视与材质行为必须统一。\n- 不要虚构可读的品牌文案、商标、界面填充文字或水印。除非需求提供精确文案，否则文字区域仅作为受控占位。\n\n## 成品结构\n- 保持人体、手部、服装逻辑与角色识别特征一致；姿势、表情、镜头和背景都必须服务同一身份。\n- 固定为头肩或胸像近景：脸部约占画面 60–75%，双眼必须清晰对焦，保留自然皮肤纹理；不得出现全身、远景、遮挡脸部的手势、过度磨皮或变形五官。\n\n## 质量门槛\n- 输出前检查焦点层级、物理可信度、主体一致性、意外文字、重复对象、错误肢体和意外标志。\n- 避免素材感填充、复制既有营销活动视觉、美术无关叠层、裁切错误和水印样痕迹。\n- 已知限制：这是未经验证的起始案例；在实际生产使用前，请人工复核生成结果、文字与品牌合规性。",
        "en": "Make a realistic editorial close-up portrait of {{subject_description}}, an East Asian woman in {{city_context}} just after rain. Show only her head and upper shoulders, with the face taking about 65% of the frame and both eyes sharply resolved. The subject wears {{wardrobe}}. Let soft wet-street reflections and distant city color become abstract bokeh behind her; use gentle open shade and a few natural damp hair strands. Preserve authentic pores, subtle under-eye texture, a natural lip finish, and a quiet sideward gaze. Capture on an 85mm lens at f/2.5, documentary color, realistic skin tones. No full body, no umbrella or crowd blocking the face, no exaggerated rain effect, no synthetic smoothing, no warped facial features, no readable signs, no text, no logo, no watermark.\n\n## Production protocol\n\n### Brief integrity\n- `{{subject_description}}` (Subject Description): Concrete value: East Asian Rain Street Closeup; the visual directly delivers the case summary and subject description role\n- `{{wardrobe}}` (Wardrobe): The main subject of the East Asian Rain Street Closeup cover, with identity and appearance anchored to Portrait Character and stable face, hair, wardrobe, and pose cues\n- `{{city_context}}` (City Context): The complete environment shown in East Asian Rain Street Closeup; it directly supports the case summary with readable foreground, midground, and background layers\n- Keep the requested subject, use case, and visual hierarchy more important than generic style adjectives.\n\n### Output contract\n- Deliver one finished, presentation-ready image for this exact brief; do not create a moodboard, contact sheet, process sheet, mockup collection, or multiple competing layouts.\n- Use one focal hierarchy, a restrained palette, coherent light direction, and enough negative space for the intended communication.\n- Do not fabricate readable brand copy, trademarks, UI filler, or watermarks. Treat any text area as a controlled placeholder unless exact copy is supplied.\n\n### Deliverable requirements\n- Keep anatomy, hands, wardrobe logic, and character-defining features consistent. Direct pose, expression, lens perspective, and background so they all support one identity.\n- Use a head-and-shoulders or upper-chest close-up only: let the face occupy roughly 60–75% of the frame, keep both eyes sharply focused, preserve natural skin texture, and exclude full-body framing, distant views, obscuring hands, heavy beauty retouching, and warped facial features.\n\n### Quality gate\n- Before finalizing, check focal hierarchy, physical plausibility, subject consistency, unintended text, duplicate objects, broken anatomy, and accidental logos.\n- Avoid stock-like filler, copied campaign aesthetics, unrelated overlays, framing errors, and watermark-like marks.\n- Known limitation: Use the prompt as a starting point and review model output before production use."
      }
